DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppaammttoowwiinniiccoonn reads an RGB_ALPHA Netpbm PAM file and converts  it  to  a
       Microsoft Windows icon file.

       The output goes to Standard Output.

       The  input is a multi-image PAM file; each image becomes an icon in the
       output file.  If you have input images in multiple files, you can  sim‐
       ply combine them with ccaatt and pass the result to ppaammttoowwiinniiccoonn.



